{"title": "Fire Kills at Least 5 at Bengal Hotel Near Tarapith Temple", "summary": "A fire broke out at Hotel Bideshinii near the Tarapith temple in Birbhum, West Bengal, on Monday morning. At least five guests were killed and several others were critically injured. The blaze quickly spread through the hotel, trapping sleeping guests. Firefighters responded to the scene and extinguished the flames. The exact cause of the fire is under investigation.", "summary_points": ["A fire erupted at Hotel Bideshinii in Birbhum, West Bengal, near the Tarapith temple.", "The incident occurred on Monday morning.", "At least five people died, and several others were injured.", "The fire spread rapidly, trapping guests who were asleep.", "Firefighters controlled the blaze."], "title_hi": "तारापीठ मंदिर के पास बंगाल के होटल में आग, कम से कम 5 की मौत", "summary_hi": "पश्चिम बंगाल के बीरभूम में तारापीठ मंदिर के पास स्थित होटल बिदेशिनी में सोमवार सुबह आग लग गई। इस घटना में कम से कम पांच मेहमानों की मौत हो गई और कई अन्य गंभीर रूप से घायल हो गए। आग तेजी से होटल में फैल गई, जिससे सो रहे मेहमान फंस गए। अग्निशामकों ने घटनास्थल पर पहुंचकर आग पर काबू पाया। आग का सटीक कारण जांच के दायरे में है।", "summary_points_hi": ["पश्चिम बंगाल के बीरभूम में तारापीठ मंदिर के पास होटल बिदेशिनी में आग लग गई।", "यह घटना सोमवार सुबह हुई।", "कम से कम पांच लोगों की मौत हुई और कई अन्य घायल हुए।", "आग तेजी से फैली, जिससे सो रहे मेहमान फंस गए।", "अग्निशामकों ने आग पर काबू पाया।"], "framing": {"center": ["Reported the death toll ranging from 5 to 7.", "Mentioned the location near the Tarapith temple and the hotel's name, Hotel Bideshinii.", "Stated that guests were trapped while sleeping.", "Noted that rescue operations were underway or had concluded."], "right": ["Reported a death toll of 6.", "Emphasized that people were sleeping when the fire broke out.", "Stated that the identities of the deceased were not yet known."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["मृतकों की संख्या 5 से 7 के बीच बताई गई।", "तारापीठ मंदिर के पास स